        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HAB.2.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hab 2:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni mucereze munyumvirize, yemwe ababa ku kiyaga; amahanga ni yiyubure, asubire mu nkomezi nsha, bīgire hafi; maze bahēreko bavuge: twegerane, tubūrane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 36:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.45.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 45:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.46.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "46:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni nde yavyukije ūva i burasirazuba, akāma anesha ukw ashingūye ikirenge? Amugomoreye amahanga, amuha kuganza abami, ayagomorera inkota yiwe iyahindura nk’umukungugu, n’umuheto wiwe uyahindura nk’ibishingwe bikubebga n’umuyaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arabatōta, agenda aja imbere ata nkomanzi; mber’ ajana inzira ibirenge vyiwe bitigeze gucamwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.44.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 44:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.1.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ivyah 1:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.22.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "22:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni nde yabikoze akabishitsa, ahamagaye abantu uk’ urunganwe rwabo rwagenda rukurikirana uhereye kw itanguriro? Ni jewe Uhoraho, uwa mbere n’ uw’ iherezo, ni jewe nyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ababa ku kiyaga barabibonye, baratinya; abo ku mpera z’isi bahinda agashitsi: bīgira hafi, baraza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuntu wese yafashije umubanyi wiwe, akabarira mugenzi we, ati Gumya umutima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.40.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 40:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.40.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuk’ umuhinga aremesha umucuzi w’izahabu, ūryohoza inyundo akaremesha ūcurira kw ibuye, akavuga, at’ Ivyuma twabiteranije neza; maz’ akagikomeresha imisumari ngo kigume.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
